### ============================================================
### REFRESH TOKEN
### ============================================================

### Refresh - valid token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}


### Refresh - invalid token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "this-is-not-a-real-token"
}


### Refresh - empty token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}


### Refresh - missing token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}
